s/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPb3VGQl9aSGZuWW92Ym9SM21TNUZqc21BekZva2FwUHhOVEZQN2VNN0VuRTl3c1MzSkg3Qnc4Ui1LbEJFbWdzZGdXTzZEMVJPUkZHYVRuanF6M2hJd0hodzRzejVSalBTaXlEczZaS1ZRX2J2R3dlVXRYM0lKeERHRXRfdHIyaVY5Q05ZMGwzSkt3X0JMcmZhN1BDbHdCUmpoaXdKTkx6N1dHNFR6RHNVOA?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"股息再投資為伊利賠償 (ERIE) 高管 Sarah Shine 增加了 16.127 個遞延薪資積分。"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":8},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":6}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-23","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/922621/000162828026010666/erie-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Erie Indemnity Company (\"Indemnity\", \"we\", \"us\", \"our\") is a publicly held Pennsylvania business corporation that has since its incorporation in 1925 served as the attorney-in-fact for the subscribers (policyholders) at the Erie Insurance Exchange (\"Exchange\"). The Exchange, which also commenced business in 1925, is a Pennsylvania-domiciled reciprocal insurer that writes property and casualty insurance. The Exchange has wholly owned property and casualty insurance subsidiaries including: Erie Insurance Company, Erie Insurance Company of New York, Erie Insurance Property & Casualty Company and Flagship City Insurance Company, and a wholly owned life insurance company, Erie Family Life Insurance Company (\"EFL\").","zh":"伊利賠償公司（「賠償」、「我們」、「我們」、「我們的」）是一家賓州上市商業公司，自 1925 年成立以來一直擔任伊利保險交易所（「交易所」）訂戶（保單持有人）的實際律師。該交易所也於 1925 年開始營業，是一家註冊於賓州的互惠保險公司，承保財產和傷亡保險。交易所擁有全資財產保險子公司：伊利保險公司、紐約伊利保險公司、伊利保險財產及意外傷害公司和旗艦城市保險公司，以及全資人壽保險公司伊利家庭人壽保險公司（“EFL”）。"},{"en":"Our primary function as attorney-in-fact is to perform policy issuance and renewal services on behalf of the subscribers at the Exchange. We also act as attorney-in-fact on behalf of the subscribers at the Exchange with respect to all claims handling and investment management services, as well as the service provider for all claims handling, life insurance, and investment management services for the Exchange's insurance subsidiaries, collectively referred to as \"administrative services\". Acting as attorney-in-fact in these two capacities is done in accordance with a subscriber's agreement (a limited power of attorney) executed individually by each subscriber (policyholder), which appoints Indemnity as each subscriber's attorney-in-fact to transact certain business on their behalf. In accordance with the subscriber's agreement for acting as attorney-in-fact in these two capacities, we ret","zh":"我們作為實際代理人的主要職能是代表交易所的認購人執行保單簽發和續保服務。我們也代表交易所的認購者就所有索賠處理和投資管理服務擔任事實上的代理人，以及為交易所的保險子公司提供所有索賠處理、人壽保險和投資管理服務（統稱為「行政服務」）的服務提供者。作為這兩種身分的事實上代理人，是根據每個訂戶（保單持有人）單獨簽署的訂戶協議（有限授權書）來完成的，該協議指定 Indemnity 作為每個訂戶的事實上的代理人，代表他們處理某些業務。根據訂戶關於擔任這兩種身份的事實上的律師的協議，我們 ret"},{"en":"We operate under a single reportable segment: management operations. Financial information about this segment is set forth in and referenced to Item 8. \"Financial Statements and Supplementary Data - Note 4, Segment Information, of Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements\" contained within this report. Further discussion of financial results for our single operating segment is provided in and referenced to Item 7. \"Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations\" contained within this report.","zh":"我們在單一可報告部門下運作：管理營運。有關該分部的財務資訊載於本報告第 8 項「財務報表及補充資料 - 合併財務報表附註的附註 4，分部資訊」中並引用。有關我們單一經營分部財務績效的進一步討論，請參閱本報告中第 7 項「管理階層對財務狀況及經營績效的討論與分析」。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We operate under a single reportable segment: management operations. Financial information about this segment is set forth in and referenced to Item 8. \"Financial Statements and Supplementary Data - Note 4, Segment Information, of Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements\" contained within this report. Further discussion of financial results for our single operating segment is provided in and referenced to Item 7. \"Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations\" contained within this report.","zh":"我們在單一可報告部門下運作：管理營運。有關該分部的財務資訊載於本報告第 8 項「財務報表及補充資料 - 合併財務報表附註的附註 4，分部資訊」中並引用。有關我們單一經營分部財務績效的進一步討論，請參閱本報告中第 7 項「管理階層對財務狀況及經營績效的討論與分析」。"},{"en":"The policy issuance and renewal services we provide on behalf of the subscribers at the Exchange are related to the sales, underwriting and issuance of policies. The sales related services we provide include agent compensation and certain sales and advertising support services. Agent compensation includes scheduled commissions to agents based upon premiums written as well as incentive compensation, which is earned by achieving targeted measures. Agent compensation comprised approximately 71% of our 2025 policy issuance and renewal expenses. The underwriting services we provide include underwriting and policy processing and comprised approximately 8% of our 2025 policy issuance and renewal expenses. The remaining services we provide include customer service and administrative support. We also provide information technology services that support all the functions listed above that comprise","zh":"我們在交易所為訂戶提供的保單簽發和續保服務涉及保單的銷售、承保和簽發。我們提供的銷售相關服務包括代理商報酬以及某些銷售和廣告支援服務。代理人薪酬包括根據保費向代理人收取的預定佣金以及透過實現有針對性的措施獲得的激勵性薪酬。代理人薪酬約占我們 2025 年保單簽發和續保費用的 71%。我們提供的核保服務包括核保和保單處理，約占我們 2025 年保單核發和續保費用的 8%。我們提供的其餘服務包括客戶服務和行政支援。我們也提供支援上述所有功能的資訊技術服務，包括"}],"customers":[{"en":"The policy issuance and renewal services we provide on behalf of the subscribers at the Exchange are related to the sales, underwriting and issuance of policies. The sales related services we provide include agent compensation and certain sales and advertising support services. Agent compensation includes scheduled commissions to agents based upon premiums written as well as incentive compensation, which is earned by achieving targeted measures. Agent compensation comprised approximately 71% of our 2025 policy issuance and renewal expenses. The underwriting services we provide include underwriting and policy processing and comprised approximately 8% of our 2025 policy issuance and renewal expenses. The remaining services we provide include customer service and administrative support. We also provide information technology services that support all the functions listed above that comprise","zh":"我們在交易所為訂戶提供的保單簽發和續保服務涉及保單的銷售、承保和簽發。我們提供的銷售相關服務包括代理商報酬以及某些銷售和廣告支援服務。代理人薪酬包括根據保費向代理人收取的預定佣金以及透過實現有針對性的措施獲得的激勵性薪酬。代理人薪酬約占我們 2025 年保單簽發和續保費用的 71%。我們提供的核保服務包括核保和保單處理，約占我們 2025 年保單核發和續保費用的 8%。我們提供的其餘服務包括客戶服務和行政支援。我們也提供支援上述所有功能的資訊技術服務，包括"}],"competition":[{"en":"Our primary function as attorney-in-fact is to perform policy issuance and renewal services on behalf of the subscribers at the Exchange. We also act as attorney-in-fact on behalf of the subscribers at the Exchange, as well as the service provider for the Exchange's insurance subsidiaries, with respect to all administrative services. There are a limited number of companies that provide services under a reciprocal insurance exchange structure. We do not directly compete against other such companies, given we are appointed by the subscribers at the Exchange to provide these services.","zh":"我們作為實際代理人的主要職能是代表交易所的認購人執行保單簽發和續保服務。我們也代表交易所的認購者以及交易所保險子公司的服務提供者擔任所有行政服務的事實上的律師。在互惠保險交換結構下提供服務的公司數量有限。我們不直接與其他此類公司競爭，因為我們是由交易所的認購者指定提供這些服務的。"},{"en":"The direct and affiliated assumed premiums written by the Exchange drive our management fee, which is our primary source of revenue. The property and casualty insurance industry is highly competitive. Property and casualty insurers generally compete on the basis of customer service, price, consumer recognition, coverages offered, claims handling, financial stability and geographic coverage. Vigorous competition, particularly in the personal lines automobile and homeowners lines of business, exists from large, well-capitalized national companies, some of which have broad distribution networks of employed or captive agents, by smaller regional insurers, and by large companies who market and sell personal lines products directly to consumers. Innovations by competitors or other market participants may also increase the level of competition in the industry. In addition, because the insurance","zh":"交易所收取的直接和附屬假設保費推動了我們的管理費，這是我們的主要收入來源。財產保險業競爭激烈。財產和意外傷害保險公司通常在客戶服務、價格、消費者認可、提供的保險範圍、索賠處理、財務穩定性和地理覆蓋範圍等方面進行競爭。激烈的競爭，特別是在個人保險、汽車和房主業務領域，來自大型、資本充足的全國性公司（其中一些擁有廣泛的僱傭或專屬代理人分銷網路）、較小的區域保險公司以及直接向消費者營銷和銷售個人保險產品的大公司。競爭對手或其他市場參與者的創新也可能增加行業的競爭水平。另外，因為保險"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Policy Issuanceand Renewal Services","val":3131806000,"zh":"保單簽發及續保服務"},{"name":"Administrative Services Reimbursements","val":836639000,"zh":"行政服務報銷"},{"name":"Administrative Services Management Fee","val":74058000,"zh":"行政服務管理費"},{"name":"Service Agreement","val":24755000,"zh":"服務協定"}],"total":4067258000}},"peers":["RLI","SIGI","RNR","BANF","MCY"]}}